# BEGIN open-source-core: ignore
# Owned by open-source-core (template/.gitignore). Change it there, never in a copy: its tooling rewrites the copies.
# The app's own lines go outside this block.
/target
/dist
# Private working notes: reviews, audits, open security problems (CONTRIBUTING.md). Never committed.
/.private
# A dev-link (`cargo xtask dev-link`): this machine's paths and the lock file of the linked build.
/.cargo/dev-link/
.DS_Store
*.swp
# END open-source-core: ignore
